; With --unround, an amount that a valuation merges from several
; components keeps full precision when any of its parts did, on every run,
; whether -V or -X merges it.
;
; Assets:Broker holds 10 AAPL and 86.66667 EUR (100.00 EUR less the
; 13.33333 EUR paid for the AAPL at 1.333333 EUR), which --unround keeps
; at full precision.  -V values the AAPL at the later price of 1.5 EUR,
; and -X EUR,USD converts it to EUR, the first commodity named, at the
; same price: 15 EUR, a new amount that prints at EUR's two decimals.
; Either way the two euro amounts merge into 101.66667 EUR.  Adding two
; amounts keeps only the left one's full-precision flag, and Ledger used
; to add the components in the order in which the balance happened to keep
; them: -V printed 101.66667 EUR here, but -X with several commodities,
; which merges by a route of its own, printed 101.67 EUR and left out the
; <Adjustment> that -V's register shows.  That order changes from run to
; run, so a merge now keeps full precision whenever one of its parts did,
; whichever is added first.  Without --unround the total prints as
; 101.67 EUR, as it always did.
;
; In the register the purchase's 10 AAPL, converted at the price its cost
; set, is 13.33333 EUR and prints as 13.33 EUR, while the running total
; keeps full precision, 113.33333 EUR: the <Adjustment> of 0.00333 EUR
; makes the column add up, as under -V.
;
; The second journal is cmd-pricemap.test's; -p 2012 picks it, and the
; Assets query the first.  -X '$,AAA' keeps the AAA and H's $-10.00 and
; converts the euros and pounds to dollars, so the dollar total merges
; $-10.00, kept at full precision, with converted amounts that are not:
; $-10.17494, where Ledger used to drop the extra digits on some runs and
; not on others.

2024/01/01 Opening
    Assets:Broker     100.00 EUR
    Equity

2024/01/02 Buy
    Assets:Broker      10 AAPL @ 1.333333 EUR
    Assets:Broker

P 2024/02/01 AAPL 1.5 EUR

; The journal of cmd-pricemap.test.
P 2012-03-25 EUR 0.83 GBP
P 2012-03-25 EUR 1.32 $
P 2012-03-25 USD 0.75 EUR
P 2012-03-25 AAA $10.00

2012-03-23 * Test 1
    C               20.00 EUR @@ 16.71 GBP
    D

2012-03-24 * Test 2
    E               30.00 GBP
    F

2012-03-25 * Test 3
    G          1 AAA @ $10.00
    H

test bal -V --unround Assets
       101.66667 EUR  Assets:Broker
end test

test bal -X EUR,USD --unround Assets
       101.66667 EUR  Assets:Broker
end test

test reg -X EUR,USD --unround Assets
24-Jan-01 Opening               Assets:Broker            100.00 EUR   100.00 EUR
24-Jan-02 Buy                   <Adjustment>            0.00333 EUR 100.00333 EUR
                                Assets:Broker             13.33 EUR 113.33333 EUR
                                Assets:Broker          -13.33333 EUR   100.00 EUR
24-Feb-01 Commodities revalued  <Revalued>              1.66667 EUR 101.66667 EUR
end test

test bal -X EUR,USD Assets
          101.67 EUR  Assets:Broker
end test

test bal -X '$,AAA' --unround -p 2012
              $26.40  C
             $-26.57  D
              $47.71  E
             $-47.71  F
               1 AAA  G
             $-10.00  H
--------------------
          $-10.17494
               1 AAA
end test
